## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env       # fill in real values
uv sync --all-groups
docker compose up
```

## Day one

The repo ships with `apps/example/` as a placeholder (one `Item` model with CRUD). Replace it with your domain models:

```bash
git rm -r apps/example
# add your own apps under apps/
```
